2026-07-03 12:04:16','2026-07-03 12:04:16','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Rick Singer duped me out of $6.5 million, student\'s mother says','','inherit','closed','closed','','239-revision-v1','','','2026-07-03 12:04:16','2026-07-03 12:04:16','',239,'http://test-wordpress/wordpress/?p=240',0,'revision','',0),(241,1,'2026-07-03 12:05:31','2026-07-03 12:05:31','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Never ever think of giving up. Winners never quit and</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','The Week in Pictures: April 25 - May 2','','publish','open','open','','the-week-in-pictures-april-25-may-2','','','2026-07-04 18:06:18','2026-07-04 18:06:18','',0,'http://test-wordpress/wordpress/?p=241',0,'post','',0),(242,1,'2026-07-03 12:05:23','2026-07-03 12:05:23','','blog-3','','inherit','open','closed','','blog-3','','','2026-07-03 12:05:23','2026-07-03 12:05:23','',241,'http://test-wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/blog-3.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(243,1,'2026-07-03 12:05:31','2026-07-03 12:05:31','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Never ever think of giving up. Winners never quit and</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','The Week in Pictures: April 25 - May 2','','inherit','closed','closed','','241-revision-v1','','','2026-07-03 12:05:31','2026-07-03 12:05:31','',241,'http://test-wordpress/wordpress/?p=243',0,'revision','',0),(244,1,'2026-07-03 12:06:55','2026-07-03 12:06:55','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Never ever think of giving up. Winners never quit and</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Measles scare at Newark Airport, cruise ship','','publish','open','open','','measles-scare-at-newark-airport-cruise-ship','','','2026-07-04 17:57:07','2026-07-04 17:57:07','',0,'http://test-wordpress/wordpress/?p=244',0,'post','',0),(245,1,'2026-07-03 12:06:51','2026-07-03 12:06:51','','blog-4','','inherit','open','closed','','blog-4','','','2026-07-03 12:06:51','2026-07-03 12:06:51','',244,'http://test-wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/blog-4.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(246,1,'2026-07-03 12:06:55','2026-07-03 12:06:55','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Never ever think of giving up. Winners never quit and</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Measles scare at Newark Airport, cruise ship','','inherit','closed','closed','','244-revision-v1','','','2026-07-03 12:06:55','2026-07-03 12:06:55','',244,'http://test-wordpress/wordpress/?p=246',0,'revision','',0),(247,1,'2026-07-03 12:07:27','2026-07-03 12:07:27','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your clients would like to see optimal results for minimal work. For this reason, it can be difficult to convince them that a website redesign enhances SEO strategies. However, if you try to redesign a site without taking SEO into account, you are going to face bigger problems down the road.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start off by explaining to clients what will happen if you ignore SEO in your redesign. Explain to them how a website redesign enhances SEO strategies across the board. A redesign is essential and should be part of your client’s budget. There are a couple of risks to point out.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"30px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":271,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://test-wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bd-more-1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-271\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":270,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://test-wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bd-more-2-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-270\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"30px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">You May Have to Redo All Your Content</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is impossible to create effective content without taking SEO into consideration. If you create content without thinking about SEO, you may need to go back and redo all the new content you made for your website when you start your SEO strategy. There are a few reasons for this. First, you’ll be unsure as to what keyword terms you want to rank for. If you write content that doesn’t include appropriate keywords, it will be difficult to go back and include the terms naturally. Second, you may be unclear as to who makes up your target audience. The content you write for the wrong audience is useless and will need replacing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">You May Have Technical Mistakes</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Technical mistakes may mean you require a site migration in the near future. This is a huge waste of time. Taking the technical side of SEO into account now will allow you to decide on</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:lazyblock/quote-custom {\"quote-image\":\"%7B%22alt%22:%22%22,%22title%22:%22quote%22,%22caption%22:%22%22,%22description%22:%7B%22raw%22:%22%22,%22rendered%22:%22%3Cp%20class=%5C%22attachment%5C%22%3E%3Ca%20href=\'http://test-wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/quote.png\'%3E%3Cimg%20loading=%5C%22lazy%5C%22%20decoding=%5C%22async%5C%22%20width=%5C%2245%5C%22%20height=%5C%2236%5C%22%20src=%5C%22http://test-wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/quote.png%5C%22%20class=%5C%22attachment-medium%20size-medium%5C%22%20alt=%5C%22%5C%22%20/%3E%3C/a%3E%3C/p%3E%5Cn%22%7D,%22id%22:283,%22link%22:%22http://test-wordpress/wordpress/inside-the-100-million-upgrade-in-americas/quote/%22,%22url%22:%22http://test-wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/quote.png%22,%22sizes%22:%22%22%7D\",\"textarea\":\"We need to stop interrupting what people are interested in and be what people are interested in.”\",\"name\":\"Mitchell Jackson\",\"position\":\"CEO-DeerCreative\",\"blockId\":\"ZrqdlN\",\"blockUniqueClass\":\"lazyblock-quote-custom-ZrqdlN\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All the above assumes that a client is willing to create a website in the first place. Some clients may believe that they can forgo a website entirely. However, without a website, it is impossible for a business to grow. You need to explain why having an SEO-optimized website is necessary for being found online. Of course, businesses can find customers using other means, such as through social media, but these methods are slower. Plus, users will still expect the business to have a website — to obtain more information about products, services, and the brand as a whole.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Inside the $100 million upgrade in America’s','','publish','open','open','','inside-the-100-million-upgrade-in-americas','','','2026-07-05 06:28:07','2026-07-05 06:28:07','',0,'http://test-wordpress/wordpress/?p=247',0,'post','',0),(248,1,'2026-07-03 12:07:23','2026-07-03 12:07:23','','blog-5','','inherit','open','closed','','blog-5','','','2026-07-03 12:07:23','2026-07-03 12:07:23','',247,'http://test-wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/blog-5.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(249,1,'2026-07-03 12:07:27','2026-07-03 12:07:27','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Never ever think of giving up. Winners never quit and</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Inside the $100 million upgrade in America’s','','inherit','closed','closed','','247-revision-v1','','','2026-07-03 12:07:27','2026-07-03 12:07:27','',247,'http://test-wordpress/w