re going to face bigger problems down the road.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start off by explaining to clients what will happen if you ignore SEO in your redesign. Explain to them how a website redesign enhances SEO strategies across the board. A redesign is essential and should be part of your client’s budget. There are a couple of risks to point out.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":271,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://test-wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bd-more-1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-271\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":270,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://test-wordpress/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bd-more-2-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-270\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">You May Have to Redo All Your Content</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is impossible to create effective content without taking SEO into consideration. If you create content without thinking about SEO, you may need to go back and redo all the new content you made for your website when you start your SEO strategy. There are a few reasons for this. First, you’ll be unsure as to what keyword terms you want to rank for. If you write content that doesn’t include appropriate keywords, it will be difficult to go back and include the terms naturally. Second, you may be unclear as to who makes up your target audience. The content you write for the wrong audience is useless and will need replacing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Ins